      "message": "Is this enough?  Doesn\u0027t the bug apply to other cases where users have a parent-child relationship too?  For example, suppose that a full user other than user 0 has a work profile.  This could be e.g. user 10 having a profile with user ID 11.  User 10 would need to be unlocked before user 11 in that case.",
