      "writtenOn": "2024-05-23T19:27:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Was it agreed on that a managed profile needed to be unlocked after the parent profile? From b/324085891#comment10, it looks like the system user must be unlocked first but there isn\u0027t a strict requirement that a a parent\u0027s profile must be unlocked before a managed profile.",
