      "writtenOn": "2024-05-23T19:41:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e a parent\u0027s profile must be unlocked before a managed profile.\n\nIt\u0027s supposed to work that way, and as far as I know Android doesn\u0027t do otherwise (except in this RoR case).",
